# AI Usage Disclosure — Milestone 1

We used ChatGPT during this milestone to:

1. Draft and refine project-related prompts
2. Generate and format the PDF report using the content and findings we supplied
3. Develop statistical questions for the five visualizations, choose suitable chart types, and improve readability, including by using a logarithmic axis for the area boxplot
4. Get occasional help with Python code and parts of the data extraction process
5. Cross-check selected facts and identify relevant sources to consult and cite

We also consulted documentation and programming forums directly for many coding questions
